ooden door and steps into the luxurious palace bedroom.\nSound: wooden door creak + soft royal music\n\n3-6s:\nMedium shot pushing in. Emperor’s eyes widen in surprise and delight. Close-up of him gently lifting a soft strand of Wan Fei’s long fluffy dark wavy hair with his fingers, full of admiration. Wan Fei smiles coyly with perfect voluminous hair.\n台词（皇帝，深情）：「爱妃发丝如云……今夜留在朕身边。」\nSound: soft romantic tone\n\n6-9s:\nMedium two-shot. Wan Fei takes out the exact Batiste bottle from the product reference image (white body, light blue gradient, white butterflies/clouds/hearts, green logo, blue “FRAGRANCE FREE”, white cap) and hands it to the emperor. They look at the modern bottle together — emperor curious and slightly confused, Wan Fei proudly smiling. Funny ancient-vs-modern contrast.\nSound: light playful music\n\n9-12s:\nComedy product showcase: Both emperor and Wan Fei hold the exact white-and-blue Batiste Fragrance Free bottle together toward camera. Emperor looks amused/puzzled, Wan Fei bright confident smile. Chubby eunuch in background with exaggerated shocked open mouth and double thumbs-up. Final hero shot of them presenting the bottle clearly.\n台词（贵妃，俏皮对镜头）：「通宵打牌也不怕！碧缇丝干发喷雾，去油蓬松！」\nSound: cheerful music peak + gentle freeze on their faces + accurate product.\n\nStyle: photorealistic, exact product from reference image held jointly by emperor and Wan Fei, warm cinematic golden grading, ancient Chinese palace aesthetic, no text, no subtitles, no watermarks."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(21, 23, 27, 0.96)", "size": [372.9141540527344, 484.7674560546875], "pos": [-2376.626220703125, 4990.47607421875], "id": 141, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 11}, {"